  "$id": "https://torviello.local/contracts/schemas/common/status/413.schema.json",
  "title": "413 Content Too Large",
  "description": "RFC 9110 \u00a715.5.14; class client_error; engine use: used.\nTrigger: The request body, batch, frame, or artifact exceeds the configured limit.\nContent: application/problem+json (ErrorEnvelope).\nRequired headers: none.\nCache-Control: no-store; retry: never.",
